      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ここまで力を合わせてきた二人を\r\n最後に戦わせるなんて……。\r\nちょっとひどくない？",
        "official_en": "Making the two who went through the trials together fight each other at the end? That’s a bit twisted, don’t you think?",
        "real_en": "Making two people who've worked together this far fight each other at the end... Isn't that a little cruel?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
