        "official_en_sha256": "06ea4234c0e5d9ede23f7bdd5c183090108d94ce3620f67dc8d9054d084dc2ec"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "何迷ってるんだよ。\r\nそうしなきゃクリスタルのところに\r\n辿り着けないんだぞ。",
        "official_en": "What are you waiting for? We can’t get to the Crystal unless we do this.",
        "real_en": "Why are you hesitating? We can't get to the Crystal unless we do this."
      },
      "review": {
