        "official_en_sha256": "53dc3908a48393b659fa5f20e674c9d2f4c119f2a2dd5bbb9f7486c8eb69f597"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "最後？\r\nじゃ、すげえ強い魔物でも出てくるのか？",
        "official_en": "The last one? So what, are we talking about dancing with some undefeatable monster?",
        "real_en": "Last? So we're up against some incredibly strong monster?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
