        "official_en_sha256": "102af96d784977a365e4772208582df8d3a00a0aa03b56340130018de460090c"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "真剣勝負のふりをするって手もあるだろうが……。\r\nバレたら聖騎士と認められないかもな。",
        "official_en": "You <text style=\"italic\">could</> fight and pretend like you’re not pulling your punches...but if the shrine calls your bluff, it might reject both of you.",
        "real_en": "We could pretend to fight seriously, but if they catch on, they might not recognize either of you as a Paladin."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
