        "official_en_sha256": "30cae15ef8cb20d75a02d27c4828db54bf619f19f13aeefc2775e1700470dd99"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "石碑には真剣勝負と書かれておる。",
        "official_en": "The stele is quite explicit in its instruction. The duel shall need to be “an earnest” one—you must commit fully to the contest.",
        "real_en": "The tablet says it has to be a serious duel."
      },
